It has been installed 300+ times within a week!&lt;p&gt;If you try the CogniKernel and if it's genuinely been helpful I would love to know some feedback, maybe a GitHub star can covey that as I'm still continuing my research on it to improve the quality and making your AI assistants work with no amnesia!&lt;/p&gt;
